---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="Privacy | Pranjal Pandey" description="How this website handles newsletter signups, guide requests, booking links and privacy questions.">
  <div class="wrap"><header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy / Updated 16 October 2026</p><h1>Your email is not a trade-off.</h1></header>
    <div class="reading"><p>This personal website is operated by Pranjal Pandey. For privacy questions or requests, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
      <h2>Reading this site</h2><p>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub may process request information, including IP addresses, to serve and protect the website. See <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub's privacy statement</a>.</p><p>This build does not install Google Analytics, Google Ads or the LinkedIn Insight Tag. Fonts and the portrait are served with the website, not requested from Google Fonts.</p>
      <h2>The guide and monthly letter</h2><p>If you request the guide, your email address is submitted to Kit to handle the request, confirmation and delivery, and to send <em>Practical AI</em>, my monthly letter. The signup page states this before you submit.</p><p>Kit's form script loads on pages with an inline signup. It can process technical request and form-interaction information. See <a href="https://kit.com/privacy">Kit's privacy policy</a>. A guide confirmation or delivery message is additional to the monthly letter.</p><p>You can unsubscribe using the link in an email, or contact me for help. I keep subscriber information while you remain subscribed or as needed to handle your request and meet applicable obligations. You can ask to access, correct or delete your information by email; necessary records may be retained where required.</p>
      <h2>Bookings and paid sessions</h2><p>Booking links take you to Cal.com or Topmate. Those providers handle the information you submit, scheduling and any payment. This website does not collect payment card details. Check <a href="https://cal.com/privacy">Cal.com's privacy policy</a> and <a href="https://topmate.io/privacy">Topmate's privacy policy</a> before booking.</p>
      <h2>Email and confidential information</h2><p>If you email me, I use your message to respond and manage the conversation. Please don't send private client data, credentials or sensitive materials in an initial enquiry.</p>
      <h2>Changes</h2><p>If the website adds analytics, advertising or other processors, this notice and any required consent controls need to be updated before those tools are enabled.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
